    "workspaceInstruction": "# Congressional Signals\n\nThis workspace monitors official House Periodic Transaction Reports (PTRs) only using the pinned current House roster. It is a research-triage workspace, not a trading system and not complete congressional coverage.\n\nUse only the authorized House projection and the `evaluate_congressional_signals` capability. Preserve disclosed ranges, measured coverage, immutable correction lineage, and ambiguity. Never infer intent, wrongdoing, exact value, holdings, future returns, or an instruction to trade.\n"
